  // Hardmode life: once the Mawwall falls the radiant and blighted lands fill with new creatures, and the deep caverns
  // and the night grow meaner everywhere. Their drops (essences of light and night, glimmer dust, prism horns, blight
  // embers, sanguine ichor) feed the hardmode stations' recipes and the mechanical summons.
